        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "The Company offers several learning opportunities through partnerships with one of the leading online learning providers, business school certificate programs, tuition reimbursement for post-secondary degree granting programs, and individual career coaching.",
